    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll try mixing it with the compost tea like you said. one more thing—i've been seeing these weird little holes in the leaves too, almost like something's been nibbling at the edges overnight. do you think that's just common pests or could it be a deficiency thing too?",
